text = "[center][font_size=24][b]PERSONAL LOGS FROM MEMORY & TIMELINE[/b][/font_size][/center]
[center]________________________________________________________________________________[/center]

[center][font_size=18][b]✨   PRESENT STATUS ✨[/b][/font_size][/center]

[b]📍   Location & Living Situation:[/b] Currently residing in Pampanga, Philippines since [i]August 10, 2025[/i]. Living with my mother’s younger sister (aunt) and her business driver.

[b]🛠️   Activities & Side Hustles:[/b]
• Local Repairs: Accepting requests for laptop and cellphone repairs from my aunt’s friends and acquaintances.
• Content Creation: Posting gaming and tech content online via Facebook and YouTube.
• Marketplace: Managing [url=www.facebook.com/marketplace/profile/100055752107854/]Facebook Marketplace Listings[/url] to sell unused devices.
• Crypto/Fintech: Tracking Cashbacks/Promos from registered platforms like PDAX (Philippine Digital Asset Exchange) and maintaining ties to the Local Crypto/Web3 Community.

[b]📹   Recent Projects:[/b]
• [b]First-Time GPU Repasting:[/b] Completed my very first thermal paste replacement and deep clean on a dedicated graphics card (Zotac GTX 1070 Mini with Backplate) earlier today. YouTube Video: [url=youtu.be/zFa8XLHAn0c]MyYouTubeChannel[/url]
• Promo Tracking: [url=www.facebook.com/share/p/18AftaaiBg/]PDAX Promos & Updates[/url].
• Showing how it's done... Giving it away for free when you realize, we're all just kind of ripping each other off anyways so whatever... LOL
• Somehow I'm still getting some money flowing in via connections and private contracts. Too \"laissez-faire\" at this point..

[center]________________________________________________________________________________[/center]

