[b]Current Valid IDs & Papers:[/b]
• [color=green]Philippine Passport[/color] (Valid until August 27, 2028)
• Birth Certificate
• NBI Clearance
• [color=red]Philippine Driver’s License[/color] (Expired since 2022)

[center]________________________________________________________________________________[/center]

[center][font_size=18][b]🏥   HEALTH & MEDICAL MANAGEMENT[/b][/font_size][/center]

[b]History:[/b] Taking maintenance medication since [i]2005[/i] following an initial diagnosis in Al Khobar, Saudi Arabia.
[b]Current Status:[/b] Managing health costs closely without spending heavily on prescriptions. Skipped doses in the past have caused health consequences. I have not applied for an official PWD (Person with Disability) ID yet.

[center]________________________________________________________________________________[/center]

