[b]📅   Apr. 5, 2024[/b]
•   [b]NFT worth around \\$800 at first release:[/b] Acquired second promotional Ramen Card NFT via community event raffle.
•   Supposedly only 1 Ramen Card per player if they got it from events or promos. But you can buy as much of them as you want from the marketplace. If I remember correctly this one was from a community event raffle rather than a official game event, hence I was allowed to keep another. The NFT Card has benefits tied to it which is being able to buy and sell exclusive in-game items (“food buffs” in most games). At initial release the price for that was around \\$800 and I was one of lucky winners of it then. The other player I met then who won as well sold it for that price and got himself a better computer set from it. I decided to not sell mine yet at that price which I later kind of regretted since now I don’t have any of those Ramen Cards though 2 went through my possession. I sold this one for \\$70, Transaction Details/Blockchain Record in the link below. [s]I still log into the game from time to time but only to farm tokens($1~/6days currently, back then $10/day for me and for others even more).[/s] Currently the game has just finished transferring ownership and management and I haven't tried getting back to it yet.
•   [b][url=www.youtube.com/live/29u_R8qiuRs?t=616s]Video of the Raffle Event[/url][/b]
•   [b][url=polygonscan.com/tx/0xb37c30d6885370114e37b72898056fbed21f3088a5ca66f373a5705135245a09]Blockchain Record of This(2nd Time) NFT when I sold it.\\$70[/url][/b]
•   [b][url=polygonscan.com/tx/0x8381e313faef2b82fa372d1e59f7d68c267541474194d371cfa18dc19e123605]Blockchain Record of my 1st of this NFT sold.\\$390[/url] [/b]
•   If you can trace transactions on the blockchain scanners. You'll notice that I use multiple wallet addresses and I will state this now that during those times, KYC on crypto wallets, wasn't a thing yet. It's something anyone on the internet can just get/generate and use freely. And if you trace the NFT's history, it's minted(airdropped/given/rewarded) to those 2 wallets that sold them as well which are mine.

